From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 05:57:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Prepare modeled CAB response geometry once per generation

Share request-local speaker, microphone, horn, and enclosure preparation across v1, v2, and v3 while preserving frequency arithmetic and cancellation cadence. Freeze the 8097 generators for independent exact-bit and full-waveform comparisons, and add an opt-in fixed ABBA generator diagnostic without changing acceptance gates.
